  "boxes": [
    {
      "type": "anchorbox",
      "title": "The Reward of Education",
      "description": "Why the golden glow and beautiful earrings (Kanan Kundal)? According to tradition, when Hanuman completed his immense, relentless education under the Sun God, Surya was so impressed by his student that he gifted him a fraction of his own blinding brilliance and divine earrings as a graduation gift. True radiance is not just physical, it is the result of dedication, hard work and earned through good education.",
      "motivating_text": "His brilliant, golden radiance was not inherited, but earned through the disciplined fire of his actions.",
      "citation": "Kishkindha Kanda, 66"
    },
    {
      "type": "gotchabox",
      "items": [
        "Phonetic Shifts: सुवेष (Suvesha) becomes सुबेसा (Subesaa) — exhibiting both the व → ब and श/ष → स shifts simultaneously! Likewise, केश (Kesha) becomes केस (Kesa)."
      ]
    }
  ]
